    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaakoba Abaisiraeli ati: “Gano n'amateeka n'ebiragiro bye muli n'okutuukiriza n'obwegendereza enaku dhoonadhoona dhe munaamala nga muli balamu, mu nsi Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa badhaadha baimwe y'ali kubagha okutwala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muli n'okuzikiriza ebifo byonabyona, ab'amaghanga ge muja okutwala mwe basinziza bakatonda baibwe: ku nsozi enene, ni ku busozi obutono, ni ghansi mu binsense by'emiti emizibirivu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumenhemenhengagho alutaari dhaibwe, mutemetemenga empango dha bakatonda baibwe edh'amabaale, mwokyeyokyenga ebifaananie ebibaadhe eby'omusambwa gwaibwe omukazi Ashera, era mwasaageyasaagenga ebintu byaibwe bye basinza ebitali Katonda, byerabirirwenga irala ku nsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 7:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Imwe mutasinzanga Musengwa Katonda waimwe mu nsambo abantu abo ye basinzaamu bakatonda baibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu biketezo by'ebika byaimwe byonabyona, Musengwa Katonda waimwe aidha kulondamu ekifo kirala, abantu ye banaajanga mu maiso ge okumusinza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyo ye munaatwalanga ebigheebwayo byaimwe ebyokebwa, n'emisengo gyaimwe, n'ekintu ekirala kye mughaayo ku buli bintu eikumi bye mufuna, n'ebigheebwayo byaimwe ebindi bye mughaayo, n'ebigheebwayo olw'okutuukiriza obweyamo, n'ebigheebwayo eby'ekyeyendere, n'ensolo dhaimwe edhizaalibwa mu luzaalo olusooka dhe mughaayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyo, nga muli mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda waimwe, imwe n'ab'omu maka gaimwe ye mwidha okuliiranga n'okusagambiranga, olw'ebyo byonabyona bye munaabanga nga mukoze nga Musengwa Katonda oyo abaghaire enkabi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekiseera ekyo bwe kituukanga, mutakolanga nga bwe tubairenga tukola okutuusa ni leero. Buli muntu abairenga ng'akola ekyo ky'abona nga n'ekituufu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba mukaali kutuuka mu nsi eyo, Musengwa Katonda waimwe y'ali kubagha ye munaabangamu nga mutyaime miraala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye bwe munaasomoka omwiga Yorudani, Musengwa Katonda waimwe aidha kubagha ensi eyo mugitwale. Aidha kubawonianga abazigu baimwe ababeezungulwire, mubenga miraala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda waimwe alirondagho ekifo eky'okumusinzizangamu. Eyo ye munaatwalanga ebyo byonabyona bye mbalagiire: ebigheebwayo byaimwe ebyokebwa, n'emisengo gyaimwe, n'ekintu ekirala kye mughaayo ku buli bintu eikumi bye mufuna, n'ebigheebwayo byaimwe ebindi bye mughaayo, n'ebyo ebigheebwayo olw'okutuukiriza obweyamo bwaimwe ye Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwidha kusagambiranga eyo mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda waimwe, nga muli ghalala ni batabane baimwe, n'abairu baimwe abasaadha n'abakazi, n'Abalevi abali mu bibuga byaimwe kuba, Abalevi abo tibaja kufuna mugabo gwa itaka lya nsikirano, gwaibwe ku bwaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwekuumenga mulobe kugheerangayo ebigheebwayo byaimwe ebyokebwa mu buli kifo kye muba muboine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye mubigheerengayo mu kifo ekyo kyonka Musengwa Katonda ky'aidha okulondagho, mu kiketezo eky'ekindi ku bika byaimwe. Eyo ye munaagheerangayo ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa, era ye munaakoleranga ebyo byonabyona bye ndi kubalagira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye mwidha kubanga ba idembe okwitira ensolo n'okuliira emamba yaadho woonawoona ghe munaabanga, era nga Musengwa Katonda bw'anaabanga ng'abaghaire. Abalongoofu n'abatali balongoofu banaabanga ba idembe okulya ku mamba eyo, ng'oti ni bwe balya ku y'empuuli n'ey'empongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye mutalyanga ku musaayi gwa nsolo yoonayoona. Mwidha kuguyughanga bwa ku itaka ng'oti maadhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
